{
  "page": "1080SnowboardingRecompiled.html",
  "header": [
    "1080° Snowboarding's extended plan for play_page.mjs, under 5 minutes with every timeout counted: it starts as the",
    "regular plan does (the launcher, Load ROM once the page has its shader list, the intro and the title, Match Race on",
    "Normal with the first rider and board) and rides Crystal Lake against the rival, then quits from the pause menu",
    "(Continue, Retire, Restart, Quit), which in Match Race goes to the title, and through the title's mode list goes to",
    "Time Attack with the first rider and board on Crystal Peak; then quits again, which in Time Attack goes back to its",
    "board select, and with the same rider and board rides Golden Forest, the course right of the one last picked. Each",
    "course is 36 s of the game's time with the default keys: leaning forward, a turn each way and a jump every 12 s. The",
    "rides are on the game's own clock, its frame counter (frames() in tools/game_state.js, 30 a second), so every browser",
    "rides as far whatever frames it gives the game; the menus' presses are timed in the browser's, as the regular plan's",
    "are. Each course's start is a need on its course data (map4 Crystal Peak, map3 Golden Forest) being loaded",
    "(tools/game_state.js), which nothing before it in a run loads, and the plan waits for the title by the line its demo",
    "prints as it loads Crystal Lake (\"map7_data.uso loaded\")."
  ],
